      "en": "I heard a sound from heaven like the sound of many waters and like the sound of a great thunder. The sound which I heard was like that of harpists playing on their harps.",
      "ko": "내가 하늘에서 나는 소리를 들으니 많은 물소리도 같고 큰 뇌성도 같은데 내게 들리는 소리는 거문고 타는 자들의 그 거문고 타는 것 같더라",
      "source_text_hash": "ae931afe10d518191e08f58fc235ad3e6e2798613fd03d49e7c60ac06dd24f72",
      "translation_text_hash": "83ac7057e4e4106ff2c7f0baca93f6f1e8faa1bcad0b98bf6842a2437bbbe7a7",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
